{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"次の打ち合わせで使う資料、香盤表、現地の地図──","trans":"下次碰头要用的资料、演出顺序表、当地地图──","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"それからプリン","trans":"还有布丁","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029420010","name":"円香","text":"プリン？","trans":"布丁？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"プリン","trans":"布丁","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029420020","name":"円香","text":"これも次の打ち合わせで使うんですか？","trans":"这个也是下次碰头要用的吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"いや、これはただのお裾分けだ\r\nよかったら","trans":"不，这个只是分你一点\n不嫌弃的话","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029420030","name":"円香","text":"……ホワイトデーなら一週間前だったと思いますが","trans":"……白色情人节的话，我记得是一周前吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"え……！？\r\nそ、そうだっけ……","trans":"诶……！？\n是、是这样吗……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-17","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はは……\r\nいえいえ","trans":"哈哈……\n不不","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}